# Scene & Generation Rules

## Scene analysis

Extract structure only: environment, composition, pose, lighting, color.
Do not identify original people in reference images.

## Generation

- Tool: `CallDynamicTool` → `cursor` / `GenerateImage`
- `aspect_ratio`: `3:4` (小红书), `9:16` (壁纸)
- `reference_image_paths`: [scene, tom ref, james ref] as applicable
- Save outputs to `outputs/approved/` or `outputs/rejected/`

## Pipeline order

virtual-couple → character-registry → scene-analyzer → **scene-customizer (text options in chat, wait)** → character-composer → prompt-builder → GenerateImage → quality-control → xiaohongshu-post

pose-series (approved still + 换姿态) → character-registry → look-lock JSON → **pose options in chat, wait** → GenerateImage per pose → quality-control (environment lock, new pose) → xiaohongshu-post

## Style differentiation

Before GenerateImage: post numbered text options for accessories/clothing/patterns. On mobile/cloud, AskQuestion may not work — text inquiry is mandatory. Pose/composition must not change.
